- ```tabular
+ ```tabular

- column  Query form
- column  Member
- column  Returns
- row  `T is Annotated`  `apply()`  the annotations on the type `T`
- row  `T is Annotated on "f"`  `apply()`  the annotations on the field `f`
- row  `T is Annotated by A on "f"`  `apply()`  the annotations of type `A` on the field `f`
- row  `T is Annotated by A`  `fields`  each field to its annotations of type `A`
- row  `T is Annotated by A`, one field matching  `field`, `lens`  the field's name, and a lens onto it
- row  `Annotated under T`  `subtypes`  each variant of `T` to its annotations
+ column  Forme de requête
+ column  Membre
+ column  Renvoie
+ row  `T is Annotated`  `apply()`  les annotations du type `T`
+ row  `T is Annotated on "f"`  `apply()`  les annotations du champ `f`
+ row  `T is Annotated by A on "f"`  `apply()`  les annotations de type `A` du champ `f`
+ row  `T is Annotated by A`  `fields`  chaque champ associé à ses annotations de type `A`
+ row  `T is Annotated by A`, un seul champ correspondant  `field`, `lens`  le nom du champ, et une lentille sur lui
+ row  `Annotated under T`  `subtypes`  chaque variante de `T` associée à ses annotations

